      "date": "2026-05-28T19:50:37.000Z",
      "title": "Full year 2026 earnings released: EPS: ₹1.83 (vs ₹0.83 in FY 2025)",
      "body": "Full year 2026 results: EPS: ₹1.83 (up from ₹0.83 in FY 2025). Revenue: ₹4.14b (up 27% from FY 2025). Net income: ₹218.6m (up 120% from FY 2025). Profit margin: 5.3% (up from 3.0% in FY 2025). The increase in margin was driven by higher revenue. Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has increased by 2% per year but the company’s share price has increased by 14% per year, which means it is tracking significantly ahead of earnings growth.",
      "keyDevTypeId": null,
